# Product Documentation

> **Owner:** Product / BA Lead | **Audience:** End Users

Welcome to the {{PROJECT_TITLE}} user documentation. This folder describes
the product **as it ships to users** — what users see, do, and rely on.
Plain language, no implementation detail.

This is a **product-level** doc surface. Its content predates any project
(see `docs/PRODUCT_BASELINE.md` for current status) and is updated through
**Product Deltas** at slice close.

