## How this folder grows

A Product Delta with target `01-product/*` is proposed at:
- BA Publish stage (per `docs/04-project/harness/engineering/ba-workflow.md`)
- Feature close stage (per `docs/04-project/harness/engineering/implementation-workflow.md`)

The slice author writes the delta **fresh** for end-user audience — not by
copying the product spec. Implementation language belongs in 03-technical;
business rules belong in 02-business; user-facing how-to belongs here.
